.key ROUNDS/A
; soakraw ROUNDS: vscsitest on the raw units 0-2 (never unit 4, the
; filesystem disk), ROUNDS times; each round's tally line to
; SHARED:vscsi/soak/raw.log.
FailAt 30
Echo "start" >SHARED:vscsi/soak/raw.log
Date >>SHARED:vscsi/soak/raw.log
Set n 0
Lab round
RAM:vscsitest vscsirs.device 3 5 >RAM:vtr.out
Search RAM:vtr.out "tests passed" >>SHARED:vscsi/soak/raw.log
Set n `Eval $n + 1`
If VAL $n LT <ROUNDS>
  Skip round BACK
EndIf
Echo "end after $n rounds" >>SHARED:vscsi/soak/raw.log
Date >>SHARED:vscsi/soak/raw.log
Echo "raw done" >SHARED:vscsi/soak/raw.done
